    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your strategy on the fly as you're presented with new upgrades for each of your 15 potential towers! Add powerful potions to your arsenal to defeat the endless hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic Resistance begins like any other tower defense game, except this time, you can't use the exact same strategy in every situation. Every few levels you will be met with a choice to gain a new tower, item, ability, or upgrade to help you on your journey, with enough options to make every run feel unique.</p>",
